    {
      "id": "nNK1pnhnTPrIl33y1s_j6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1139.33349609375,
      "y": 826.6666259765625,
      "width": 321.5999755859375,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1511431504,
      "version": 564,
      "versionNonce": 2089395120,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1742816732164,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "数据包转发的两种情况：\n1.一开始这个数据包就要转发到其他机器上，\n经过forward链会检查数据包的去向\n2.响应的数据包的目的地址在别的机器上，\n经过forward链会检查数据包的去向\n不管是哪种情况都会经过postrouting链",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "数据包转发的两种情况：\n1.一开始这个数据包就要转发到其他机器上，\n经过forward链会检查数据包的去向\n2.响应的数据包的目的地址在别的机器上，\n经过forward链会检查数据包的去向\n不管是哪种情况都会经过postrouting链",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XkBwJ8a7eT4Ad4PS_uNzz",
